 * 5. As the owner, lock the thread.
 * 6. As the owner, try to update the locked thread (should be forbidden).
 * 7. (If allowed) delete the thread; attempt update – expect forbidden or not found.
 * 8. Create a second thread with another slug; then try to update first thread with duplicate slug – expect validation error.
 *
 * Each forbidden or failed update should be verified via TestValidator.error().
 */
export async function test_api_discussionboard_test_update_thread_by_non_owner_or_with_invalid_state(
